    "kind": "markdown",
    "source": "# Balatro Seed Search Exploration\n\nThis notebook demonstrates how to search for seeds matching specific Balatro run criteria using JAML filters.\n\n## What is JAML?\n\n**JAML** (Jimbo's Ante Markup Language) is a YAML-based filter language for describing Balatro seed characteristics. Use `must` (required conditions), `should` (scoring conditions), and `mustNot` (exclusions) to find seeds matching your criteria."
  },
  {
    "kind": "filter",
    "source": "id: example_search\nname: \"Find Perkeo on Red Gold\"\nauthor: \"Example\"\ndeck: Red\nstake: Gold\n\nmust:\n  - joker: Perkeo\n\nshould:\n  - joker: Blueprint\n    score: 25\n  - boss: The Psychic\n    score: 15"
  },
  {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "source": "## This Filter\n\nRuns a search on **Red deck, Gold stake** looking for:\n- **Must have**: Perkeo (required)\n- **Scoring**: Blueprint (+25 points), The Psychic boss (+15 points)\n\nThe search will find all matching seeds and rank them by score. Try editing the filter above and running it with the cell Run button."
  },
  {
    "kind": "filter",
    "source": "id: keyword_search\nname: \"Seeds with specific keywords\"\ndeck: Blue\nstake: White\n\nmust:\n  - tag: RareTag"
  },
  {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "source": "## Alternative: Keyword Search\n\nThis filter searches for **Blue deck, White stake** seeds that have a **Rare Tag**. Run this cell independently to explore different criteria.\n\nSee the [JAML documentation](https://github.com/OptimusPi/MotelyJAML) for the full list of available jokers, vouchers, bosses, and other filter options."
  }
